Dependencies that are not stored here
-------------------------------------

* rusty-kaspa v2.1.0 (ISC), a git dependency of the Rust workspace, and the kaspa-wasm SDK
  built from the same release (fetched by web/scripts/fetch-sdk.mjs, not committed).

* Malachite (malachite-base and malachite-nz 0.9.2, arbitrary-precision arithmetic by Mikhail
  Hogrefe, https://github.com/mhogrefe/malachite) -- GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 only
  (LGPL-3.0-only). It is not a dependency of KOB's own code: kaspa-math (rusty-kaspa v2.1.0)
  uses it, and Cargo links it statically into every binary built from this workspace that
  depends on kaspa-math (the native programs such as kob-executor and kob-cli, and
  kob_wasm_bg.wasm, which the web app serves to browsers). The rest of KOB stays under the ISC
  License; the LGPL applies to Malachite itself.

  Distributing such a binary (a release archive, a container image, the built web app) is a
  distribution of a "Combined Work" under LGPL-3.0 section 4. With every distributed binary:
    - state that it contains Malachite and that Malachite is licensed under LGPL-3.0-only;
    - include the texts of the GNU LGPL v3 and of the GNU GPL v3, which it supplements;
    - keep Malachite's copyright notices with any copyright notices the program displays;
    - make it possible for the recipient to rebuild the program with a modified Malachite. A
      Rust program is statically linked, so this means offering the Corresponding Source:
      the KOB source of the same commit with Cargo.lock (this public repository at that
      commit is enough when the release points to it) and the Malachite source of the locked
      version (crates.io, or its repository above); a rebuild with a modified Malachite is a
      `[patch.crates-io]` entry in Cargo.toml;
    - do not add terms that forbid modifying the program for one's own use or reverse
      engineering it to debug such modifications.
  `cargo deny check licenses` (deny.toml) accepts LGPL-3.0-only for these two crates only, so
  another copyleft dependency is not taken in unnoticed.

